cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this formalization, please cite this software and the
  Deng--Shen paper on which it is based.
title: >-
  anderson4d: A Lean 4 formalization of the four-dimensional Anderson model
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Deng
    given-names: Yu
  - family-names: Shen
    given-names: Hao
  - name: sairmath
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and mathlib formalization of the finite-family Fourier-mode form
  of Deng and Shen's theorem on the four-dimensional Anderson model,
  conditional on the explicit statement of Proposition 3.6.
repository-code: https://github.com/sairmath/anderson4d_lean
url: https://sairmath.github.io/anderson4d_lean/
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - mathlib
  - formalized mathematics
  - Anderson model
  - stochastic partial differential equations
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      The four-dimensional Anderson model: a case study for critical SPDEs
    authors:
      - family-names: Deng
        given-names: Yu
      - family-names: Shen
        given-names: Hao
    year: 2026
    url: https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.10105
